project_id: "002"
proposer: "fiscalhost0"
title: "Semiconductor Fabrication for the learner in You"
desc: """
  We are students setting up a simple semiconductor fabrication facility, at XYZ
  University. Initially, we aim to use proven designs based on work done by
  HackerFab IIT Bombay, which in turn builds on work done by HackerFab MIT.

  We plan to start by building the lowest cost lithographic machine,
  which still cost us one lakh rupees. We have pooled some money ourselves, to
  the tune of fourty thousand rupees. Please help us raise the remaining funds.

  We have plans to make this facility available to a larger collaborator group
  beyond our university. The funds you provide will likely create benefits over
  a larger area, beyond just Chennai - which happens to be where we are located.
"""
funding_range:: 80000, 100000
campaign_url: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=project-campaign-video-id"
categories:: "short-term", "nascent"
licenses:: "MIT"
deliverables::
  - ::
    licenses:: "MIT"
    desc: """
      Complete documentation about our build, including designs friendly
      enough for fabrication at local machining vendors in Coimbatore.
      The build will be verified with students from nearby colleges, to
      ensure that everything is reproducible.
    """
  - ::
    licenses:: "CC-BY-SA-4.0"
    desc: """
      Fun and instructive videos in Tamil that serve to educate and
      encourage others to learn more and get started with semiconductors.
    """
members::
  - ::
    uid: "uid1"
    funding_range:: 80000, 100000
    fund_usage: """
      I will be buying all the required equipments.
    """
  - ::
    # This user lends extra credibility to the project helps build trust and
    # accountability. Also benefits from the visibility
    uid: "uid2"
    funding_range:: 0
    fund_usage: """
      Will be helping assemble, test and make the machine reusable.
    """
  - ::
    uid: "uid3"
    funding_range:: 0
    fund_usage: """
      Will be helping tune the software. Will also document the work, so that any
      other university can reuse our work. Will also be leading the effort to make
      the fun videos.
    """
